      <title>KCD杭州站开放CFP，聚焦Agent时代云原生与AI技术融合</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek/post/20260820/KCD%E6%9D%AD%E5%B7%9E%E7%AB%99%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BECFP%E8%81%9A%E7%84%A6Agent%E6%97%B6%E4%BB%A3%E4%BA%91%E5%8E%9F%E7%94%9F%E4%B8%8EAI%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%9E%8D%E5%90%88/</link>
